nessa! It's so good to see you!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi, Aunt Nelly! Long time no see!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: How are you? You look relaxed!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn4le02ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Vanessa</span>: Yes! Mexico is a great place, but I'm happy to be here.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: I can't wait to show you around the city. Let's take the scenic route!", "id": 2, "time": "11000", "image": "engenn4le02ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Let's park the car. We can walk from here. There is so much to do in this part of town! You can browse in the second-hand stores in Haight-Ashbury. There are so many parks nearby if you want to just go for a run. Street bands play outside cafes every day! I love ...<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">British tourist</span>: Excuse me? I'm looking for the Alcatraz Prison.", "id": 3, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn4le02ob02re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Aunt Nelly</span>: You're a long way from Alcatraz! It's down the hill, by the bay.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">British tourist</span>: I beg your pardon?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Why don't you come with us? We're going there, actually!", "id": 4, "time": "55500", "image": "engenn4le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le02ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le02ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}